# The Message That Must Arrive

Category: Across Disaster

Some messages are important.

Some messages are urgent.

Some messages must arrive.

Earthquake and tsunami warnings are among the few messages where seconds can determine survival.

Modern mobile networks carry many things:
photos, videos, advertisements, conversations.

But when disaster strikes, their most important role may be carrying a single warning.

A message that must arrive.

